  "description": "For those a little more serious about their mountain biking, the MTB Pro Disc is a high spec, affordable MTB bike.\nAvailable in both 27.5” and 29” wheel sizes to suit preferences and size requirements. The MTB Pro Disc is a great for those who want to take their riding to the next level.\nThis bike is as at home as a rugged commuter as it is riding cross country, you won’t want to put it away!\nIt’s built to last too, with oversized bars and stem, sealed bearing bottom bracket and headset, and internal cable routing.\nEquipped with an upgraded 100mm travel Zoom suspension fork with lockout feature, Shimano TX800 24-Speed EZ-fire gearing to give you all the range you would need. Stopping is upgraded to Tektro MD-280 hydraulic brakes for all condition braking power.\nThinking of heading out further or simply want that little extra, that the increase in specification brings, then the MTB Pro Disc is for you.",
